# OpenGET — OSRS Grand Exchange prices
Live margins, ROI and money-making calculators. Free, no accounts.

## Flip finders
=> /ge/margin Highest margins — profit per item after tax
=> /ge/roi Highest ROI — profit per gp invested
=> /ge/potential Potential profit — margin x buy limit
=> /ge/volume High volume — what is actually trading
=> /ge/risers Biggest risers — 24 hour movers
=> /ge/fallers Biggest fallers — 24 hour movers
=> /ge/alch High alchemy — alch profit, untaxed
=> /ge/alch-low Low alchemy — the level 21 spell

## Reference
=> /ge/indices Market indices
=> /ge/calc Money makers
=> /ge/about About and credits

=> /ge/cgi-bin/ge/search Search for an item by name

You can also look an item up over finger: finger abyssal_whip@dreamstation.systems

## Notes
* Price data from the OSRS Wiki real-time prices API, run by the OSRS Wiki in partnership with RuneLite.

